  "body": "Found in the review of PR #2542 (head `a2b549a79`).\n\nWhat happens: `camcraft-ui --headless part.sc` starts headless and\nopens nothing. The file list never reaches the headless path\n(`run_headless` takes no files). The run says nothing about the file.\n\nWhat should happen: the headless start either opens the file through\nthe same command, or refuses by name on the status line. A silent\nignore is not allowed.\n\nFix idea: pass `cli_options::files(args)` into the headless path and\nreuse `launch_file::command`; report the refusal the same way.\n\nContext: PR #2542, `crates/ui/src/egui_app/mod.rs` (`run`).\n",
